    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d562">

                <pb facs="0779" n="697" sameAs="frus:frus1925v02/pg697"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">861b.6363/112: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Minister in Latvia</hi> (<hi
                            rendition="#italic">Coleman</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to
                        the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Extract]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Riga</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1925-02-27T12:00:00+01:36"><hi rendition="#italic">February 27,
                                1925—noon</hi></date>.<lb/>[Received 5:28 p.m.]</dateline></opener>
                <p>18. <hi rendition="#italic">Izvestia</hi> 24th. Supreme Soviet People’s Economy
                    applied to Moscow Province Court for the cancellation of the Sakhalin concession
                    contract with the Sinclair Prospecting [<hi rendition="#italic"
                    >Exploration</hi>] Company on the ground that it failed to begin prospecting
                    within the stipulated time and to expend stipulated amounts for technical
                    preparations in connection with such work. Hearing March 11th.<anchor n="2"
                        xml:id="d562-f1"/></p>
                <p rendition="#center">. . . . . . . . . . . . . .</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Coleman</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d562-f1" n="2" xml:id="d562-f1-content">
                <p>The Minister in Latvia reported in despatch No. 2762, Apr. 11, 1925, that the
                    Moscow Province Court had annulled the Sinclair contract on March 24. The
                    Minister reported in despatch No. 2947, June 12, 1925, that the Soviet Supreme
                    Court had rejected an appeal by the Sinclair Exploration Co. against the
                    decision of the lower court. (File Nos. 861b.6363/129, 134.)</p>
            </note>
        </listAnnotation>
    </standOff>
